type: software
title: "Board Oversight of Forced Labour Risk in Mineral Supply Chains"
abstract: "A research dashboard combining supply chain exposure (risk indicators), board oversight coding and investor stewardship votes to assess how technology company boards oversee forced labour risks in mineral supply chains, against the UN Guiding Principles on leverage, remedy and responsible exit. Planning stage."
authors:
  - name: "Board Oversight of Forced Labour Risk project contributors"
